WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.805
Welcome to Module 8 Strings and Dates in PostgreSQL
Text

00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:10.871
and time values often look simple on the screen but
they carry important analytical meaning

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:17.812
In this module we will clean text carefully parse
structured pieces from strings use regular

00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:23.391
expressions when simple functions are not enough
choose appropriate date and time types calculate
intervals

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:29.311
group events by time grain and work with time zones
Every SQL example

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:33.667
can run directly in the browser and you can copy the
same query into pgAdmin

00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:35.022
for additional practice
